    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1620-a1">

                <pb facs="1180" n="1064" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1064"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Bonney to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">San Luis Potosí</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 18, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report that on June
                    16, 1915, Mr. C. Garcin, a prominent French merchant of San Luis Potosí, was
                    arrested by the military authorities and it was reported to me he was in great
                    danger.</p>
                <p>At the request of the French Vice Consul, Mr. Enrique Reinier, I accompanied him
                    to the car of General Tomas Urbina, and together we secured the release of Mr.
                    Garcin the same day.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilbert L. Bonney.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
